      #|  group_conjugate (G:A group) s t <=>\n        s SUBSET group_carrier G /\\\n        t SUBSET group_carrier G /\\\n        ?a. a IN group_carrier G /\\ IMAGE (group_conjugation G a) s = t
      #|  !G s:A->bool.\n        group_conjugate G s s <=> s SUBSET group_carrier G
