      #|  (s:A->bool) SUBSET group_carrier G
      #|  !G h s:A->bool.\n        s SUBSET h /\\ h subgroup_of G\n        ==> group_normalizer (subgroup_generated G h) s =\n             h INTER group_normalizer G s
